    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce into action with this chaotic multiplayer party fighter! Play as bouncy balls in a physics-driven battle where speed and weight determine your impact. Choose from diverse game modes like free-for-all Fighter, high-speed Race, or strategic King of the Hill. Master power-ups like the heavy slam, rocket boost, speed burst, and time bomb to outplay your opponents. With multiple maps and dynamic gameplay, every match is a fresh test of skill, strategy, and sheer mayhem!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Party Up</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own server</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join friends in private servers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new friends in public servers</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bounce</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce off wall, friends, anything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >loads of powerups to enjoy</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rockets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Bombs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting heavy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or becoming air</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience different game modes such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King of the Hill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighters </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Worlds to explore</p>",
